  "description": "\n    ThinkGeo.Cad is a layer extension to ThinkGeo.Core that lets you read CAD drawings and render them as a feature layer alongside the rest of your map. Built on the Open Design Alliance (\"ODA\") SDK v26.7.\n\n    Supported formats (read):\n     - AutoCAD: DWG, DXF\n     - MicroStation: DGN\n     - Autodesk: DWF\n\n    Capabilities:\n     - Render CAD drawings on a ThinkGeo map alongside vector and raster layers.\n     - Reproject CAD coordinates on the fly to any spatial reference via PROJ.\n     - Override CAD styling — colors, line widths, labels — through ThinkGeo.Core.\n\n    Targets: .NET Framework 4.6.2+ and .NET Standard 2.1 (covers .NET Core 3.1, .NET 5 / 6 / 7 / 8 / 9).\n    Platforms: Windows x64 / x86 only. The bundled ODA SDK is Windows-native; CAD layers throw on Linux / macOS.\n\n    Depends on ThinkGeo.Core. Pair with a UI package for your platform — see ThinkGeo.Core for the full list.\n\n    Commercial product with a free 30-day evaluation. Sign up at https://helpdesk.thinkgeo.com/register and download ProductCenter to start.\n\n    Documentation: https://docs.thinkgeo.com/\n  ",
